{"4902200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Le Fishe", "steam_appid": 4902200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Le Fishe is a short cozy fishing game! Where players can explore different islands and talk to an interesting cast of characters and try your best to catch the biggest fish of them all! Le Fishe offers a laid-back adventure packed with charm, exploration, and rewarding discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902200/extras/f834bca7971bcfbe9dc1ee43eddd2d62.poster.avif?t=1787869007\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902200/extras/f834bca7971bcfbe9dc1ee43eddd2d62.webm?t=1787869007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902200/extras/f834bca7971bcfbe9dc1ee43eddd2d62.mp4?t=1787869007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different rods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ different fishes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >at least 1 cool fella :D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fish!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Le Fishe is a short cozy fishing game! Where players can explore different islands and talk to an interesting cast of characters and try your best to catch the biggest fish of them all! Le Fishe offers a laid-back adventure packed with charm, exploration, and rewarding discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a